OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,7,FCloud will lift and break into the
OL,8,Fafternoon, brightening up from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest leaving many places dry,
OL,10,Fwith isolated showers towards the
OL,11,Feast. Feeling fresher in gentle
OL,12,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny showers will die out
OL,15,Fthrough the evening leaving mostly
OL,16,Fclear skies as we head into the night.
OL,17,FA comfortable night to come, with
OL,18,Flower temperatures than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
