OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,6,FFriday morning, with some patchy cloud
OL,7,Fin the north. Sunshine turning hazy
OL,8,Finto the afternoon, but feeling warm
OL,9,Fin the sunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday and Sunday look dry with some
OL,13,Fwarm spells of sunshine, in gentle
OL,14,Fwinds. A chance of some much needed
OL,15,Frain developing across the region on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
